ve Guide</a></li><li id="menu-item-17897" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-post menu-item-17897"><a href="https://www.childsrealestate.com/understanding-and-surviving-foreclosure/">Foreclosure Guide</a></li></ul></li><li id="menu-item-19120" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-19120"><a href="https://www.childsrealestate.com/buying-a-home/">Buyers</a></li><li id="menu-item-11806" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-11806"><a href="https://www.childsrealestate.com/exceptional-real-estate-service-for-a-fair-price/">Sellers</a></li><li id="menu-item-2536" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page current-menu-item page_item page-item-727 current_page_item menu-item-has-children menu-item-2536"><a href="https://www.childsrealestate.com/flat-fee-property-management-myrtle-beach/" aria-current="page" title="Myrtle Beach Rental &#038; Property Management Services">Management</a><ul class="sub-menu"><li id="menu-item-19535" class="menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom menu-item-19535"><a href="https://www.childsrealestate.com/rental-application/">Rental Application</a></li></ul></li><li id="menu-item-747" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-747"><a href="https://www.childsrealestate.com/connections/" title="Connect With The Best Real Estate Broker in Myrtle beach">Connect</a></li><li id="menu-item-18069" class="menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom menu-item-18069"><a href="https://homesandcondosforsale.myrtlebeachhomesandlifestyles.com/idx/search/advanced">Search</a></li></ul></nav><div id="et_mobile_nav_menu"><div class="mobile_nav closed"> <span class="select_page">Select Page</span> <span class="mobile_menu_bar mobile_menu_bar_toggle"></span></div></div></div> <!-- #et-top-navigation --></div> <!-- .container --></header> <!-- #main-header --><div id="et-main-area"><div id="main-content"><article id="post-727" class="post-727 page type-page status-publish hentry"><div class="entry-content"><div class="et-l et-l--post"><div class="et_builder_inner_content et_pb_gutters3"><div class="et_pb_section et_pb_section_0 et_pb_fullwidth_section et_section_regular" ><div class="et_pb_module et_pb_fullwidth_image et_pb_fullwidth_image_0 et_animated et-waypoint"> <img decoding="async" src="https://childsrealestate.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/08/100_3072_cr_cr.jpg" alt="" title="" /></div></div><div class="et_pb_section et_pb_section_1 et_section_regular" ><div class="et_pb_row et_pb_row_0"><div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_4_4 et_pb_column_0  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child"><div class="et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_0  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light"><div class="et_pb_text_inner"><h1 style="text-align: center;">Renting Your Home or Condo in Myrtle Beach</h1></div></div><div class="et_pb_module et_pb_video et_pb_video_0"><div class="et_pb_video_box"><video controls> <source type="video/mp4" src="https://www.childsrealestate.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/Renting-Your-Myrtle-Beach-Home-or-Condo-Property-Managment.mp4" /> <source type="video/webm" src="https://childsrealestate.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/08/Renting-Your-Myrtle-Beach-Home-or-Condo-Property-Managment.webm" /></video></div></div><div class="et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_1  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light"><div class="et_pb_text_inner"><p><span style="font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;">Hello, I&#8217;m Mike Childs, and I&#8217;d like to &#8220;thank you&#8221; for your interest in renting your Myrtle Beach area home or condo.</span></p><p><span style="font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;">Renting your home or condo or even your commercial property can be a very rewarding, and profitable experience when you work with a dedicated property manager who puts your best interests first and foremost.</span></p><p><span style="font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;">You already know that YOU are the most important person in the local rental market. Without you there would be no opportunity for many deserving individuals and families to have quality housing. No opportunities for small businesses to establish themselves and grow. Because youÂ  are the most important person in the rental market your deserve the very best property management services available.</span></p><p><span style="font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;">And that&#8217;s my promise to you. I&#8217;ll provide you the best real estate asset management services available in this area. </span></p><p><span style="font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;">I&#8217;ll work hard for you and only you. Your best interests will be my only concern. Â </span></p><p><span style="font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;">I&#8217;ll help you preserve your property&#8217;s value. I&#8217;ll help acquire the best possible tenants. And when problems arise, I&#8217;ll deal with them effectively and efficiently. I&#8217;ll take the headaches and hassles out of renting and maintaining your myrtle beach property and I&#8217;ll save you time and money. Â </span></p><p><span style="font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;">So make sure you receive only the best property management service available. Connect with me whenever you&#8217;re considering renting your Myrtle Beach home, condo or commercial property.</span></p></div></div><div class="et_pb_module et_pb_divider et_pb_divider_0 et_pb_divider_position_ et_pb_space"><div class="et_pb_divider_internal"></div></div><div class="et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_2  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light"><div class="et_pb_text_inner"><h3><strong>Our Personal Flat Fee Service Includes &#8230;</strong></h3><p>&nbsp;</p><ul><li><span style="font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;">Monthly Fees as low as 7% &#8211; $150.00 Per Month minimum*.</span></li><li><span style="font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;">Biannual Inspections</span></li><li><span style="font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;">Monthly Accounting</span></li><li><span style="font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;">State Approved Trust Account For All Funds</span></li><li><span style="font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;">Electronic Rent Payments &amp; Transfers</span></li><li><span style="font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;">Oversee Maintenance, Repairs, and Replacements.</span></li><li><span style="font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;">Prompt Attention To and Resolution of Any Issues or Problems</span></li><li><span style="font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;">Tenant Placement and Evictions</span><ul><li><span style="font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;">No Placement Fee</span></li><li><span style="font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;">No Eviction Fee, Except Required Serving and Court Costs</span></li></ul></li><li><span style="font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;">Application Process</span><ul><li><span style="font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;">Interviews</span></li><li><span style="font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;">SC and U.S. Criminal Background Checks</span></li><li><span style="font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;">Credit Reports</span></li><li><span style="font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;">Eviction reports</span></li><li><span style="font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;">Employment and salary verification</span></li><li><span style="font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;">Pet interview and registration of breed, vaccinations, photo, size, &amp; number</span></li></ul></li></ul><p><span style="font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;">*A &amp; B Class Properties Only (Applies to Homes, Condos, &amp; Mobile Homes) </span></p><p style="padding-left: 80px;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="color: #000000;">A: Newer homes in nice neighborhoods<br />B: </span><span style="color: #000000;">Older but well maintained homes in nice neighborhoods<br /></span><span style="color: #000000;">C: Older homes with some deferred maintenance, but generally in good condition.<br />D: </span><span style="color: #000000;">Much older homes with too much deferred maintenance in undesirable locations.<br />F: Very old homes with serious maintenance issues in blighted locations.</span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p></div></div><div class="et_pb_module et_pb_cta_0 et_hover_enabled et_pb_promo  et_pb_text_align_center et_pb_bg_layout_light et_pb_no_bg"><div class="et_pb_promo_description et_multi_view_hidden"></div><div class="et_pb_button_wrapper"><a class="et_pb_button et_pb_promo_button" href="https://childsrealestate.com/connections">Connect With Mike</a></div></div></div></div></div><div class="et_pb_section et_pb_section_3 et_pb_with_background et_section_regular" ><div class="et_pb_row et_pb_row_1 et_pb_row_fullwidth"><div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_3 et_pb_column_1  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough"><div class="et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_3  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_dark"><div class="et_pb_text_inner"><p><span style="color: #ffffff;"><strong>Childs Real Estate LLC</strong> is an independent family owned real estate brokerage and property management company in Myrtle Beach South Carolina.</span></p><p><span style="color: #ffffff;">Our business philosophy is simple. "You are the most important person in any real estate transaction". Without you, the buyer or seller, we would not be in business. We always put your unique needs and goals first &amp; foremost, and always representÂ  "your" best interests in every transaction.</span></p><p><span style="color: #ffffff;"><em>We guarantee our performance and your satisfaction!</em></span></p></div></div></div><div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_3 et_pb_column_2  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough"><div id="et_pb_contact_form_0" class="et_pb_module et_pb_contact_form_0 et_pb_contact_form_container clearfix" data-form_unique_num="0" data-form_unique_id="ed04b7ea-75f3-4113-8506-2046db37ef91"><h2 class="et_pb_contact_main_title">Contact Us</h2><div class="et-pb-contact-message"></div><div class="