-textSizeMedium MuiButton-colorPrimary MuiButton-root MuiButton-text MuiButton-textPrimary MuiButton-sizeMedium MuiButton-textSizeMedium MuiButton-colorPrimary mui-zrttwm LinkTo_link__fp_eP" href="/agents/">See all agents<span class="MuiButton-icon MuiButton-endIcon MuiButton-iconSizeMedium mui-1n4a93h"><svg class="MuiSvgIcon-root MuiSvgIcon-fontSizeMedium mui-vnjz4i" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" data-testid="ArrowForwardIcon"><path d="m12 4-1.41 1.41L16.17 11H4v2h12.17l-5.58 5.59L12 20l8-8z"></path></svg></span></a></div></div><div class="MuiBox-root mui-6mwctw"><div class="MuiStack-root mui-1svmaxw"><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-1namlgn">Local Agents For Your State</p><h2 class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-h2 mui-j8wu94">South Carolina-specific questions, answered.</h2><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-7ooe73">Common operator questions about running rentals on Hemlane. Each answer ties back to the state-specific workflow Hemlane runs.</p></div><div class="MuiBox-root mui-1qfu4w3"><div class="MuiBox-root mui-1tboavl"><button class="MuiBox-root mui-crl738" type="button"><span class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-1xec8af">Do I need a property management license to use Hemlane?</span><div class="MuiBox-root mui-hftidc"><svg class="MuiSvgIcon-root MuiSvgIcon-fontSizeMedium mui-pjqlsr" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" data-testid="ArrowBackIosNewIcon"><path d="M17.77 3.77 16 2 6 12l10 10 1.77-1.77L9.54 12z"></path></svg></div></button><div class="MuiBox-root mui-aq2z2w"><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-yo6a33">You do not need a license to manage your own rental properties through Hemlane. If you manage rentals on behalf of others for compensation, your state may require a real estate brokerâ€™s license. Hemlaneâ€™s local agents are licensed professionals, so owners using the Agents service are always working with a licensed local expert.</p></div></div><div class="MuiBox-root mui-1tboavl"><button class="MuiBox-root mui-crl738" type="button"><span class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-1xec8af">Does my state require a written lease agreement?</span><div class="MuiBox-root mui-hftidc"><svg class="MuiSvgIcon-root MuiSvgIcon-fontSizeMedium mui-pjqlsr" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" data-testid="ArrowBackIosNewIcon"><path d="M17.77 3.77 16 2 6 12l10 10 1.77-1.77L9.54 12z"></path></svg></div></button><div class="MuiBox-root mui-aq2z2w"><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-yo6a33">Most states strongly recommend or require written lease agreements for all rental terms. Hemlane provides state-specific lease templates that include required disclosures and legally recognized terms which are ready to send with eSign in minutes.</p></div></div><div class="MuiBox-root mui-1tboavl"><button class="MuiBox-root mui-crl738" type="button"><span class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-1xec8af">How does online rent collection work for landlords?</span><div class="MuiBox-root mui-hftidc"><svg class="MuiSvgIcon-root MuiSvgIcon-fontSizeMedium mui-pjqlsr" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" data-testid="ArrowBackIosNewIcon"><path d="M17.77 3.77 16 2 6 12l10 10 1.77-1.77L9.54 12z"></path></svg></div></button><div class="MuiBox-root mui-aq2z2w"><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-yo6a33">Hemlane automates rent collection from end to end. Tenants pay online, and funds are deposited directly to the owner and not held in a third-party account. 100% of the rent goes directly to you. Automated reminders and late fee notices reduce manual follow-up so you get paid on time without chasing tenants.</p></div></div><div class="MuiBox-root mui-1tboavl"><button class="MuiBox-root mui-crl738" type="button"><span class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-1xec8af">How do I handle late rent fees through Hemlane?</span><div class="MuiBox-root mui-hftidc"><svg class="MuiSvgIcon-root MuiSvgIcon-fontSizeMedium mui-pjqlsr" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" data-testid="ArrowBackIosNewIcon"><path d="M17.77 3.77 16 2 6 12l10 10 1.77-1.77L9.54 12z"></path></svg></div></button><div class="MuiBox-root mui-aq2z2w"><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-yo6a33">Hemlane lets you configure automated late fees that align with your stateâ€™s legal limits. The platform sends automated reminders before rent is due and late notices after. Once the process is set-up, it runs without you having to make a single call.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="MuiBox-root mui-yc4vxv"><div class="MuiStack-root mui-1cdg1u5"><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-1sgnw3">Related Resources</p><h2 class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-h2 mui-cd3li9">South Carolina-specific landlord guides</h2><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-1iepz3m">Deeper guides for specific South Carolina rental scenarios, written for landlords.</p></div><div class="MuiStack-root mui-1k9q6ep"><div class="MuiStack-root mui-10m7hmd"><a target="_self" rel="" class="MuiBox-root mui-1rze8b3 LinkTo_link__fp_eP" href="/resources/south-carolina-squatters-rights/"><div class="MuiStack-root mui-1ov46kg"><div class="MuiBox-root mui-640k4d"><svg width="0" height="0"><defs><linearGradient id="resource-icon-gradient-gavel" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="100%" y2="100%"><stop offset="0%" stop-color="#21BDE4"></stop><stop offset="100%" stop-color="#5EEDB4"></stop></linearGradient></defs></svg><svg class="MuiSvgIcon-root MuiSvgIcon-fontSizeMedium mui-rj3ium" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" data-testid="GavelIcon"><path d="m5.2494 8.0688 2.83-2.8269 14.1343 14.15-2.83 2.8269zm4.2363-4.2415 2.828-2.8289 5.6577 5.656-2.828 2.8289zM.9989 12.3147l2.8284-2.8285 5.6569 5.6569-2.8285 2.8284zM1 21h12v2H1z"></path></svg></div><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-1oh5523">South Carolin