+            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-body-text field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><h4><span class="mif-calendar"></span> Due dates</h4><p>Râ€‹eturns must be filed by the 20th of the month following the end of the filing period.</p><p>Seasonal filers should file returns for the months they had sales.â€‹</p><h4><span class="mif-laptop"></span> Amend a returnâ€‹</h4><p>â€‹â€‹â€‹â€‹Log in to your <a href="https://mydorway.dor.sc.gov"><strong>MyDORWAY</strong></a> account to amend an Accommodations Tax Return.â€‹</p><h4>Watch our tutorial for help filing a return on MyDORWAY</h4><p><iframe width="560" height="315" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/pR2uaaSWnDA?si=m4l34nd5hM45ZkIY" title="YouTube video player" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen></iframe></p></div>
