+
+<p class="p-block"><span class="inlinep">Although we canâ€™t respond individually to each comment received, we do appreciate your feedback and will consider your comments and suggestions as we revise our tax forms, instructions, and publications. <span class="bold"><strong>Donâ€™t</strong></span> send tax questions, tax returns, or payments to the above address.</span></p>
