+			<td style><span class="inlinep">&nbsp;</span></td>
+			<td colspan="3" style><span class="inlinep"><span class="bold"><strong>Note:</strong></span> Be sure to report only the personal portion of your real estate taxes on line 5b of Schedule A. The personal portion of real estate taxes on the dwelling unit doesnâ€™t include the rental portion you reported on line 2b of this Worksheet 5-1 or any portion that you deducted on other forms, such as Schedule C or F. </span></td>
+			<td style><span class="inlinep">&nbsp;</span></td>
