+			<td colspan="4" style><span class="inlinep">If you are claiming the standard deduction and you are not increasing your standard deduction by a net qualified disaster loss, do not report an amount on line 2c; instead, report the rental portion of your casualty losses on line 6a.</span></td>
+		</tr>
+		<tr>
+			<td style><span class="inlinep">&nbsp;</span></td>
+			<td colspan="4" style><span class="inlinep">If you are itemizing your deductions on Schedule A or filing a Schedule A to increase your standard deduction by a net qualified disaster loss, figure the amount to report on line 2c by using the following steps.</span></td>
+		</tr>
