+			<td colspan="4" style><span class="inlinep">Enter the total of your rental expenses that are directly related only to the rental activity. These include interest on loans used for rental activities other than to buy, build, or improve the dwelling unit. Also, include rental agency fees, advertising, office supplies, and depreciation on office equipment used in your rental activity.</span></td>
