+			<td style><span class="inlinep">&nbsp;</span></td>
+			<td colspan="4" style><span class="inlinep">If you are itemizing your deductions and you used the Line 2b Worksheet to figure the amount to include on line 2b, then include the amount from line 10 of the Line 2b Worksheet on line 4c; otherwise, do not enter an amount on line 4c.</span></td>
+		</tr>
