+		</tr>
+		<tr>
+			<td style><span class="inlinep"><span class="bold"><strong>Line 4f.</strong></span> </span></td>
+			<td colspan="4" style><span class="inlinep">You can deduct the amounts on lines 4a, 4b, 4c, and 4d as rental expenses on Schedule E only to the extent they arenâ€™t more than the amount on line 4f.*</span></td>
+		</tr>
