+		</tr>
+		<tr>
+			<td style><span class="inlinep">&nbsp;</span></td>
+			<td colspan="4" style><span class="inlinep">If you are itemizing your deductions on Schedule A or filing a Schedule A to increase your standard deduction by a net qualified disaster loss, enter the rental portion of the casualty losses attributable to the dwelling unit you rented that are in excess of the amount you figured on lines 15 and 18 of your worksheet version of Form 4684.</span></td>
+		</tr>
+		<tr>
