+Placed in Service
+You place property in service in a rental activity when it is
+ready and available for a specific use in that activity. Even
+if you arenâ€™t using the property, it is in service when it is
+ready and available for its specific use.
+Example 1. On November 22 of last year, you purchased a dishwasher for your rental property. The appliance was delivered on December 7, but wasnâ€™t installed
+and ready for use until January 3 of this year. Because the
