+Example 3. You own a rental property that you rent to
+your son. Your son doesnâ€™t own any interest in this property. He uses it as his main home and pays you a fair
+rental price.
+Your sonâ€™s use of the property isnâ€™t personal use by you
+because your son is using it as his main home, he owns
+no interest in the property, and he is paying you a fair
