+<title>2025-2026 Bill 3861: Short-term rentals - South Carolina Legislature Online</title><meta name="keywords" content="Short-term rentals"><!-- http://www.scstatehouse.gov/sess126_2025-2026/bills/3861.htm --></head>
+
+<body lang="ES-MX" style='word-wrap:break-word'><div class="statusCoverSheet WordSection1"><p style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-weight: bold;">South Carolina General Assembly</span><br>126th Session, 2025-2026</p><p>Download <a href="3861.docx">This Bill</a> in Microsoft Word Format</p><p><s>Indicates Matter Stricken</s><br><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Indicates New Matter</span></p><p style="font-weight: bold;">H. 3861</p><p style="font-weight: bold;">STATUS INFORMATION</p><p>General Bill<br>Sponsors: Reps. Hewitt, Bailey, Brewer, Murphy and Bannister<br>Document Path: LC-0028PH25.docx<br></p><p>Introduced in the House on January 30, 2025<br><span style="font-weight: bold;"> Medical, Military, Public and Municipal Affairs</span></p>Summary: Short-term rentals<p style="font-weight: bold;">HISTORY OF LEGISLATIVE ACTIONS</p><table style="border-collapse: collapse;"><thead>    <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000;">      <th style="text-align: left; padding: .35rem;">Date</th>      <th style="text-align: left; padding: .35rem;">Body</th>      <th style="text-align: left; padding: .35rem;">Action Description with journal page number</th>    </tr>  </thead><tbody><tr>    <td style="padding: .35rem;">1/30/2025</td>    <td style="padding: .35rem;">House</td>    <td style="padding: .35rem;">Introduced and read first time (<a href="https://www.scstatehouse.gov/sess126_2025-2026/hj25/20250130.htm#p44">House Journal-page 44</a>)</td>  </tr><tr>    <td style="padding: .35rem;">1/30/2025</td>    <td style="padding: .35rem;">House</td>    <td style="padding: .35rem;">Referred to Committee on <span style="font-weight: bold;">Medical, Military, Public and Municipal Affairs</span>  (<a href="https://www.scstatehouse.gov/sess126_2025-2026/hj25/20250130.htm#p44">House Journal-page 44</a>)</td>  </tr></tbody></table><p>View the latest <a href="/billsearch.php?billnumbers=3861&amp;session126&amp;summary=B">legislative information</a> at the website</p><p style="font-weight: bold;">VERSIONS OF THIS BILL</p><p><a href="https://www.scstatehouse.gov/sess126_2025-2026/prever/3861_20250130.htm">01/30/2025</a><br></p><br><br></div>
+
+<div class="WordSection1">
