+Sec. 17-396.19. Day cares. 
+Day cares are allowed subject to the following standards: 
+a. Such facility meets the rules and regulations established by the South Carolina Department of Social 
+Services. 
+b. A landscaped hedge or fence shall be provided along any rear or side property line. Any such  hedge or 
+fence shall be designed and planted to be at least five (5) feet in height and effectively block the public 
+view. 
+c. A minimum of one (1) off-street parking space be provided for each three hundred fifty (350) square 
+feet of indoor play and/or instruction space plus adequate off-street loading and unloading space with 
+separate ingress and egress. 
