+. As one of Myrtle Beachâ€™s premier golf resorts, Barefoot features four award-winning championship courses designed by legendary architects Greg Norman, Davis Love III, Tom Fazio, and Pete Dyeâ€”all conveniently located in one spectacular resort.
+Barefoot Resort & Golf is one of the premier Myrtle Beach Golf Resorts, nestled in the scenic Lowcountry of North Myrtle Beach, South Carolina. Thoughtfully designed to deliver an unmatched golf getaway, Barefoot stands apart from other East Coast golf destinations with four award-winning courses, exceptional practice facilities, and on-site accommodations.
+Dye Course
+Experience one of the most scenic Myrtle Beach golf courses at Barefoot Resort, where Greg Normanâ€™s championship layout features seven spectacular holes stretching along the Intracoastal Waterway. Surrounded by preserved native vegetation and breathtaking coastal landscapes, every hole offers a unique blend of strategic challenge and unforgettable views. Whether youâ€™re planning a Myrtle Beach golf vacation or searching for the best championship golf courses in South Carolina, the Norman Course at Barefoot Resort delivers an exceptional golf experience from the first tee to the final putt.
