,42,0.16)]" data-tooltip></div> </div> <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-[46px] h-[22px]" style="right:16px" aria-hidden="true"> <span class="absolute top-0 -translate-x-1/2 whitespace-nowrap text-[12px] leading-none text-[#64748b] max-sm:hidden" style="left:8.695652173913043%"> Nov 24 </span><span class="absolute top-0 -translate-x-1/2 whitespace-nowrap text-[12px] leading-none text-[#64748b]" style="left:21.73913043478261%"> Feb 25 </span><span class="absolute top-0 -translate-x-1/2 whitespace-nowrap text-[12px] leading-none text-[#64748b] max-sm:hidden" style="left:34.78260869565217%"> May 25 </span><span class="absolute top-0 -translate-x-1/2 whitespace-nowrap text-[12px] leading-none text-[#64748b]" style="left:47.82608695652174%"> Aug 25 </span><span class="absolute top-0 -translate-x-1/2 whitespace-nowrap text-[12px] leading-none text-[#64748b] max-sm:hidden" style="left:60.86956521739131%"> Nov 25 </span><span class="absolute top-0 -translate-x-1/2 whitespace-nowrap text-[12px] leading-none text-[#64748b]" style="left:73.91304347826086%"> Feb 26 </span><span class="absolute top-0 -translate-x-1/2 whitespace-nowrap text-[12px] leading-none text-[#64748b] max-sm:hidden" style="left:86.95652173913044%"> May 26 </span><span class="absolute top-0 -translate-x-1/2 whitespace-nowrap text-[12px] leading-none text-[#64748b]" style="left:100%"> Aug 26 </span> </div> </div> </div> <p class="mt-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-[rgba(0,0,0,0.6)]">The 12-month ADR of $419 averages each listing's own rate across its whole year; the monthly points average listings month by month, so the two differ.</p>  </figure></div> </div> <div id="revpar-analysis"> <h3>What Is the RevPAR for Airbnb in Surfside Beach?</h3><p>RevPAR, or revenue per available night, divides a listing&apos;s income by every night it was open to book, so it rises with both price and bookings. In Surfside Beach it averaged <strong>$174</strong> over the past year, from about $76 in a typical January to about $374 in a typical July.</p><p>Per open night, by tier:</p><ul class="not-prose my-5 space-y-1.5"><li><span aria-hidden="true" class="mr-2.5 inline-block h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-[2px] align-[0.05em]" style="background-color:#5f5ab8"></span><span class="font-semibold text-[#1e293b]">Best-in-class properties</span> (top 10%) earn <strong>$389+</strong> per open night, about three times the median.</li><li><span aria-hidden="true" class="mr-2.5 inline-block h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-[2px] align-[0.05em]" style="background-color:#8884d8"></span><span class="font-semibold text-[#1e293b]">Strong performers</span> (top 25%) earn <strong>$226</strong> or more, about $95 a night above the median.</li><li><span aria-hidden="true" class="mr-2.5 inline-block h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-[2px] align-[0.05em]" style="background-color:#b3b0e6"></span><span class="font-semibold text-[#1e293b]">Typical properties</span> (median) earn about <strong>$133</strong> per open night.</li><li><span aria-hidden="true" class="mr-2.5 inline-block h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-[2px] align-[0.05em]" style="background-color:#dddcf5"></span><span class="font-semibold text-[#1e293b]">Entry-level properties</span> (bottom 25%) earn <strong>$71</strong> or less, about half of the median.</li></ul><div class="not-prose my-8"><figure class="pseo-figure font-lato rounded-[4px] bg-white shadow-[0_1px_2px_rgba(15,23,42,0.06),0_3px_14px_rgba(15,23,42,0.07)] p-5 sm:p-6 [&#38;_.pseo-table]:shadow-none"> <figcaption> <p class="text-[16px] font-bold leading-snug text-[#1e293b]">July RevPAR is about five times January&#39;s</p> <p class="mt-1 text-[14px] leading-snug text-[rgba(0,0,0,0.6)]">Revenue per open night (RevPAR), by month, September 2024 to August 2026</p>  </figcaption> <div class="mt-5"><div class="pseo-line relative select-none font-lato" style="height:260px" role="img" aria-label="Revenue per open night in Surfside Beach by month, September 2024 to August 2026" data-pseo-chart> <div class="absolute bottom-[30px] left-0 top-