+        <p id="isPasted">Let&rsquo;s Celebrate America&apos;s 250th birthday together!!</p><p aria-level="2">The <strong>Surfside Beach 4th of July Golf Cart Parade</strong> is at&nbsp;<strong>10 a.m</strong>. The lineup is at the First Baptist Church of Surfside Beach, 711 16th Ave North. Dress up your carts in patriotic colors! to register, scan the QR code or click the link below! Visitors, Businesses, and Locals are all invited to participate!&nbsp;<br>Golf Cart Registration: We want you to be part of this exciting event! Please let us know if you plan to participate in the parade by registering. It&apos;s as easy as scanning the QR code or clicking the link below. All participants must register to be eligible to win prizes. There is no fee to join the fun!<br><strong>WoodmenLife Chapter 1111</strong> will present the flag, and the National Anthem will be performed live by Lori Coleman! Please join us at the flagpole</p><p>ðˆðŒððŽð‘ð“ð€ðð“ ðˆðð…ðŽð‘ðŒð€ð“ðˆðŽð: ðˆðŸ ð²ð¨ð® ðšð«ðž ð¥ð¨ðœðšð¥, ð©ð¥ðžðšð¬ðž ð©ð¢ðœð¤ ð®ð© ð²ð¨ð®ð« ð§ð®ð¦ð›ðžð« ð›ðžð­ð°ðžðžð§ ðŸ–:ðŸŽðŸŽ ðš.ð¦. ðšð§ð ðŸ“:ðŸŽðŸŽ ð©.ð¦., ðŒð¨ð§ððšð² ð­ð¡ð«ð¨ð®ð ð¡ ð…ð«ð¢ððšð², ð‰ð®ð§ðž 15th ð­ð¡ð«ð¨ð®ð ð¡ Friday, ð‰ð®ð¥ð² ðŸ‘ð«ð, ðšð­ ð“ð¨ð°ð§ ð‡ðšð¥ð¥, ðŸðŸðŸŽ ð”ð’ ð‡ð°ð² ðŸðŸ• ð’, ð’ð®ð«ðŸð¬ð¢ððž ððžðšðœð¡, ð’ð‚ ðŸðŸ—ðŸ“ðŸ•ðŸ“. ð€ ð¬ðžð¥ðŸ-ð¬ðžð«ð¯ðž ð­ðšð›ð¥ðž ð°ð¢ð¥ð¥ ð›ðž ð¬ðžð­ ð®ð© ð¢ð§ ð­ð¡ðž ð¥ð¨ð›ð›ð².</p><p><strong>Check-In:</strong> In the public parking lot at First Baptist Church of Surfside Beach, 711 16th Ave North. Enter the parking lot from North Cherry Drive. If you do not have a number, please visit the Keep Surfside Beach Beautiful Committee table to obtain one. Place the number on the right side of the golf cart so that the judges can clearly see it. The judges will be stationed at Neal &amp; Pam&apos;s.<br><strong>Route:</strong> Golf carts will turn onto 16th Avenue North, proceed to Ocean Boulevard, and then parade down to 16th Avenue South. The winners will be notified and posted on social media and the town website. <a data-fr-linked="true" href="//www.surfsidebeach.org" data-pasted="true">www.surfsidebeach.org</a></p><p>LINK TO REGISTER: <a data-fr-linked="true" href="https://www.surfsidebeach.org/FormCenter/Events-9/2026-4th-of-July-Golf-Cart-Parade-174" data-pasted="true">https://www.surfsidebeach.org/FormCenter/Events-9/2026-4th-of-July-Golf-Cart-Parade-174</a></p><h1 aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" data-pasted="true">STARS &amp; STRIPES FAM JAM | 12 pm - 3 pm | <a href="https://nealandpamsbarandgrill.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">Neal and Pam&apos;s Bar &amp; Grill</a><br><strong><em>Join us after the golf cart parade for a family fun day!&nbsp;</em></strong></h1><ul><li>Jim Quick &amp; Coastline Band: On stage from 12 pm to 3 pm&nbsp;</li><li>Ohana Kahakai&apos;s authentic Hula &amp; Fire Dancer Show from 1:30 pm to 2:00 pm</li><li>Kids Zone: Water Slide, Bounce House, Face Painting, and more!</li><li>Ice Cream Eating Contest: Drippy&apos;s Homemade Ice Cream</li></ul><h2 class="subhead1" aria-level="2">The Salute From The Shore will be held at the Surfside Beach Fishing Pier at 12:45 pm. Bring your American Flag and join us for the flyover!</h2><p><img src="/ImageRepository/Document?documentId=4849" class="fr-fil fr-dib" alt="2026 MAP" style="width: 740px;"><img src="/ImageRepository/Document?documentId=4861" class="fr-fil fr-dib" alt="2026 GC MAP" style="width: 741px;"></p><p>Book your vacation now, as you won&apos;t want to miss this! On Vacation? YES! You are invited to join in the fun!&nbsp;<br>Pier District Accommodations:<br>Holiday Inn Oceanfront Resort-Surfside Beach<br>Surfside Beach Oceanfront Resort<br>Surfside Realty Company<br>Grand Palms Resort</p><p><strong>VENDORS:</strong> We will not have any vendors at this event<br>Please note that the only way to sign up or make payment for ANY town event is through our website, <a data-fr-linked="true" href="//www.surfsidebeach.org">www.surfsidebeach.org</a>, or in person at Surfside Beach Town Hall, located at 210 U.S. HWY 17 South. Surfside Beach, SC 29575. If you have any questions, please call 843-913-6111 ext. 390. We will never ask you to make payments via social media. Be aware of scammers.</p><p><strong>For Parking information</strong>, <a href="https://www.surfsidebeach.org/202/Parking" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">click here<span class="ae-compliance-indent" style="display:none;">&nbsp;Version Options4th of July Golf Cart ParadeHeadline</span></a><br>Public Notice: Ocean Blvd will be closed from 9:30 a.m. to 12:00 p.m. for the Surfside Beach 4th of July Golf Cart Parade.&nbsp;<br>The parade kicks off at 10 a.m., proceeding from 16th Avenue North to 16th Avenue South.&nbsp;<br>Intersections along Ocean Boulevard will be reopened as the parade proceeds down Ocean Boulevard.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>#surfsidebeachsc #thefamilybeach #onetownoneteam</p><p><br></p>
