+        <h3 class="subhead2" id="isPasted" aria-level="2" role="heading"><strong>Get Ready for the 2nd Annual Surfside Beach Kite Festival!&nbsp;</strong><br>Join us for a fun-filled day at the <strong><em>Surfside Beach Fishing Pier on Saturday, April 25, from Noon - 3 PM!</em></strong><br><strong><em>No Registration Needed</em></strong></h3><p><strong>Grab your kite (or purchase one at the festival), family, and a chair, and join the fun!</strong></p><p data-pasted="true"><strong>*******PLEASE NOTE: IMPORTANT INFORMATION*******</strong><br>The Surfside Beach Pier Parking Lot will be closed from 5 AM to 5 PM on Saturday, April 25, 2026<br>KITE ZONE: 4th Ave North to 4th Ave South on Saturday, April 25, 2026 - Please do not set beach tents in this area during the festival</p><p>Enjoy!<br>Kite flying on the beach<br>Live Band: <a href="https://www.rivermistband.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">Rivermist</a><br>Music on the beach with DJ Louie<br>Delicious food trucks &amp; sweet treats<br>Face painting &amp; bounce houses<br>Foam zone &amp; beach games<br>Hula and Fire Show &nbsp;<br>Arts &amp; Crafts Vendors<br><strong><em>Official Surfside Beach Kite Festival t-shirts will be sold at the Town Merch Tent OR at the Town Hall, 210 US HWY 17 South</em></strong></p><p><strong><em><img src="/ImageRepository/Document?documentId=4797" class="fr-fil fr-dib" alt="2026 TSHIRTS POST" style="width: 583px;"></em></strong><br></p><p>Parking:&nbsp;<a href="https://www.grandpalmsresortmb.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">Grand Palms Resort</a> provides free shuttle service to and from the Town of Surfside Beach parking lots (the Pier parking lot will be closed).<br>No registration is needed!&nbsp;<br>For more parking information, click <a href="https://www.surfsidebeach.org/202/Parking" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">HERE<span class="ae-compliance-indent" style="display:none;">&nbsp;Version OptionsSurfside Beach Kite Festival Headline</span></a>.&nbsp;</p><p>Festival Vendors:<br>Food Vendor Application:&nbsp;<a href="https://www.surfsidebeach.org/FormCenter/Events-9/2026-Kite-Festival-Food-Vendor-Form-168" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">CLICK HERE<span class="ae-compliance-indent" style="display:none;">&nbsp;Version OptionsSurfside Beach Kite Festival Headline</span></a><a href="https://www.surfsidebeach.org/FormCenter/Events-9/2026-Kite-Festival-Food-Vendor-Form-168" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message"></a><br><a href="https://www.surfsidebeach.org/FormCenter/Events-9/2026-Kite-Festival-Food-Vendor-Form-168" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message"><span class="ae-compliance-indent" style="display:none;">&nbsp;Version OptionsSurfside Beach Kite Festival Headline</span></a>Arts &amp; Crafts Vendor Application:&nbsp;<a href="https://www.surfsidebeach.org/FormCenter/Events-9/2026-Kite-Festival-Art-Crafts-Vendor-For-166" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">CLICK HERE<span class="ae-compliance-indent" style="display:none;">&nbsp;Version OptionsSurfside Beach Kite Festival Headline</span></a>.<br>Please note that the only way to sign up or make payment for ANY town event is through our website, <a data-fr-linked="true" href="//www.surfsidebeach.org">www.surfsidebeach.org</a>, or in person at Surfside Beach Town Hall, located at 210 U.S. HWY 17 South. Surfside Beach, SC 29575. If you have any questions, please call 843-913-6111 ext. 390. We will never ask you to make payments via social media. Be aware of scammers.</p><p><br></p>
