+        <p><strong>Are you ready for fireworks?!? Say &quot;see you next year&quot; to summer 2026 with&nbsp;</strong><a href="#thefamilybeach" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message"><strong>#thefamilybeach</strong></a></p><p><strong>Join us for the End of Summer Fireworks Festival!&nbsp;</strong><br><strong>Date:</strong> Sunday, September 6, 2026<br><strong>Location:</strong> <a href="https://www.surfsidebeach.org/212/Surfside-Beach-Fishing-Pier" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">Surfside Beach Fishing Pier&nbsp;</a><br><strong>Time:</strong> 5:00 PM - 9:00 PM (Fireworks display begins at approx. 9 pm)</p><p><strong>Details</strong><br><strong>Fireworks Show off the Pier!!</strong><br>Live Music performed by: <a href="https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=61585652703338" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">Jennifer &amp; &nbsp;South Bound Band</a><br>Arts &amp; Crafts Vendors<br>DJ Louie<br>Food Trucks: Hurricane&apos;s Food Truck (hamburgers, hot dogs, fish), Lobster Dogs, Lemons &amp; Dough<br>Arts &amp; Crafts Vendors&nbsp;<br>Kids Zone includes: Foam Zone, Face Painting, Bounce Houses, and more!<br>Giveaways<br>***Fireworks Display will be at approx. 9 pm<br>Free shuttle service from all parking lots to and from the festival location from 5:00 p.m. to 9:30 p.m. Look for the&nbsp;<a href="https://titostrolleysc.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">Tito&apos;s Trolley</a>!<br><a href="https://www.surfsidebeach.org/341/Town-of-Surfside-Beach-Merchandise" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">Town Merchandise</a></p><p><strong>What to KNOW Before You Go:&nbsp;</strong><br>&nbsp;To help everyone enjoy the event safely and smoothly, please review the following important updates:<br>ðŸš« Pier Parking Lot Closure<br>The pier parking lot will be closed from 5:00 a.m. until the end of the event.</p><p>ðŸš§ Pier Access<br>For safety reasons, the pier (from the gate to the end) will be closed starting at 5:00 a.m. and will remain closed for the duration of the event. Chairs are not allowed on the pier platform during this event.&nbsp;<br>Businesses on the pier platform will remain open starting at 7:00 a.m.</p><p>ðŸ– Beach Access &amp; Viewing<br>Beginning at 7:00 p.m., the beach will be closed from the 5th house north of River City Caf&eacute; to Scotty&rsquo;s Beach Bar.<br>Designated viewing areas will be available on the beach at the pier for those bringing chairs.<br>Access the beach viewing area via the Pier Parking Lot Beach Access next to River City Caf&eacute;.</p><p>ðŸ…¿ï¸ Parking Information<br><a href="https://titostrolleysc.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">Tito&rsquo;s Trolley</a> will be picking up and dropping off at every public parking lot. This is a free service from 4:30 p.m. to 10:00 p.m.&nbsp;<br>PARKING INFORMATION - <a href="https://www.surfsidebeach.org/202/Parking" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">click here<span class="ae-compliance-indent" style="display:none;">&nbsp;Version OptionsEnd of Summer Fireworks FestivalHeadline</span></a>.</p><p><span class="ae-compliance-indent" style="display:none;">&nbsp;Version OptionsEnd of Summer Fireworks FestivalHeadline</span></p><p><span class="ae-compliance-indent" style="display:none;">&nbsp;Version OptionsEnd of Summer Fireworks Festi</span><a href="https://www.surfsidebeach.org/202/Parking" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message"><span class="ae-compliance-indent" style="display:none;">&nbsp;Version OptionsEnd of Summer Fireworks FestivalHeadline</span></a></p><p><span class="ae-compliance-indent" style="display:none;">&nbsp;Version OptionsEnd of Summer Fireworks FestivalHead</span><strong>Plan your vacation for the event!</strong>&nbsp;<br>We invite you to join us at Surfside Beach, also known as the Family Beach, for your next vacation. Please choose from our three hotels or explore the available rental houses to find the perfect accommodation for your stay. Our wide range of dining options will tantalize your taste buds, and numerous ocean activities will ensure a fulfilling experience. For more information, please visit our&nbsp;<a href="https://www.facebook.com/townofsurfsidebeach" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">Facebook Page</a>. We look forward to welcoming you soon!<br><strong>Pier Village Hotels</strong><br><a href="https://holidayinnsurfsidebeach.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">Holiday Inn Oceanfront Resort Surfside Beach</a><br><a href="https://www.surfsideoceanfronthotel.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">Surfside Beach Oceanfront Hotel</a><br><a href="https://www.surfsiderealty.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">Surfside Realty Company</a><br>Outside of Pier Village: <a href="https://www.grandpalmsresortmb.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">Grand Palms Resort</a><br><strong>Pier Village Restaurants</strong><br><a href="https://rivercitycafe.com/locations/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">River City Cafe</a><br><a href="https://pizzahyena.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">Pizza Hyena</a><br><a href="https://www.facebook.com/ScottysOceanfrontBeachBar/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">Scotty&apos;s Beach Bar</a><br><a href="https://nealandpamsbarandgrill.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">Neal and Pam&apos;s Bar and Grille</a><br><a href="https://bubbasfishshack.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">Bubba&apos;s Fish Shack</a><br><a href="https://chimichangallama.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">Chimichanga Llama</a><br><a href="https://graciouspig.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">Gracious Pig Smokehouse</a><br><strong>On the Pier in Pier Village</strong><br><a href="https://www.drippysicecream.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">Drippy&apos;s Homemade Ice Cream</a><br><a href="https://www.facebook.com/PerrysBaitandTackle" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">Perry&apos;s Bait &amp; Tackle</a><br><a href="https://www.facebook.com/SurfDiner1" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">Surf Diner</a><br><a href="https://whistlingducksurfside.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">The Whistling Duck Restaurant &amp; Wine Bar</a><br>Food and Beverage Kiosks</p><p id="isPasted"><strong>VENDORS:</strong> We will not have any vendors at this event<br>Please note that the only way to sign up or make payment for ANY town event is through our website, <a data-fr-linked="true" href="//www.surfsidebeach.org">www.surfsidebeach.org</a>, or in person at Surfside Beach Town Hall, located at 210 U.S. HWY 17 South. Surfside Beach, SC 29575. If you have any questions, please call 843-913-6111 ext. 390. We will never ask you to make payments via social media. Be aware of scammers.</p>
