+ IV. Expert Evidence of Loss of Use Damages 
+ Appellants argue the trial court erred in
+ denying their motion to exclude the testimony of Respondents' expert on loss of
+ use damages because the unit owners were in different positions vis-Ã -vis the
+ use of their units.Â  Appellants argued the expert's theory, that a non-permanent
