+<body bgcolor="#FFFFFF" lang="EN-US">
+<p align="center"><b>THE STATE OF SOUTH CAROLINA<br>
+</b><b>In The Supreme Court</b></p>
+<hr align="center" width="20%" noshade>
+<blockquote>
+  <blockquote>
+    <blockquote>
+      <blockquote>
+        <p>Crossmann
+          Communities of North Carolina, Inc., Beazer Homes Investment Corp., and
+          Daniel Rogers, Respondents/Appellants,</p>
+      </blockquote>
+    </blockquote>
+  </blockquote>
+</blockquote>
+<p align="center">v.</p>
+<blockquote>
+  <blockquote>
+    <blockquote>
+      <blockquote>
+        <p>Harleysville
+          Mutual Insurance Company, Cincinnati Insurance Company, and Associated
+          Insurors, Inc., of Myrtle Beach, Defendants,</p>
+        <p>of whom
+          Harleysville Mutual Insurance Company is Appellant/Respondent.</p>
+      </blockquote>
+    </blockquote>
+  </blockquote>
